<title>INDIA: India's Exide 1996/97 net higher.</title>
<headline>India's Exide 1996/97 net higher.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>	     (in million rupees unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		309.3  vs     204.1</p>
<p>    Net sales	     4,012.8  vs   2,829.3</p>
<p>    Shr (in rupees)	  12.4 vs	 9.43</p>
<p>    Other income	     26.9  vs	30.3</p>
<p>    Total expenditure   3,328.7  vs   2,404.2</p>
<p>    Interest costs	  222.7  vs     151.9</p>
<p>    Depreciation	    114.4  vs	61.1</p>
<p>    Tax			  61.1  vs	15.0</p>
<p>Note: Exide Industries Ltd said the results were audited</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom (91-22-265 9000)</p>
</text>
